  "content": "\n\n<div style=\"display:flex\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1319/112/minecraft_title-png.png\" alt=\"标志\" width=\"1673\" height=\"592\"></div>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<p>欢迎来到 Create: Fuel &amp; Water Information！本模组旨在为您的 HUD 添加燃料和水量等级。本模组源于我们个人希望在 HUD 上查看燃料和水量的需求。非常感谢 <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Stuff and Additions</a> 提供的喷气背包和手持钻机工具！&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>开发者</strong></h3>\n<p>Jopgood&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>美术</strong></h3>\n<p>WindValley</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/Jopgood/create-information-addon/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/qPmjSXy.png\" alt=\"问题反馈\" width=\"160\"></a></p>\n<h4>前往 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-fuel-and-water-information\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curseforge</a> 页面了解更多关于该模组的信息</h4>",
